 "notes": "Groundwater-flow model report. Simulated values (scenario heads, water budgets, simulated hydraulic conductivity, pilot-point calibration values in table 2 and figure 5, simulated 2015 and 2050 altitudes in table 6, simulated potentiometric maps) were not recorded. Figure 2 (observed November 2014 Middendorf potentiometric surface, from Wachob 2015) is a head map, not a geologic surface, and its contour labels cannot be tied to lines from the text; not recorded. Geologic units are from the figure 4 framework diagram (column layout); ages read from it are inferred. Table 1 transmissivity, storage and calculated conductivity are reported ranges per aquifer. Reported pumping rates (tables 3-5) and county water use (figure 8) are water use, not tests. Hydrographs (figures 3, 7) were not read. Abstract says declines of as much as 249 ft; introduction says 250 ft of total decline. General modelling and climate references skipped.",
